mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: collabs-and-cross-promotion\ndescription: >-\n  Creator collabs and cross-promotion — organic creator-to-creator partnerships that swap\n  audiences. Use when someone wants to set up a collab, audience swap, cross-promotion, shoutout\n  swap, joint giveaway, guest spot, joint video/series, a YouTube/IG collab post, or co-promo with\n  another creator. Picks a complementary, similar-size, values-aligned partner, agrees the plan\n  before creating, and co-creates shared-value content (not a bare shoutout) on a coordinated\n  schedule. Uses the UNITE framework. Reads brand-profile + goals-and-kpis first. WoopSocial\n  publishes each partner's OWN posts to their OWN\n  accounts; it does NOT create native IG Collab co-authored posts, run giveaways, duet/stitch, or\n  manage the agreement. A pure mutual collab isn't a sponsorship, but\n  payment/free product makes it one -> disclose -> ugc-and-influencer; partnerships must be genuine;\n  metrics never fabricated. Distinct from ugc-and-influencer (brand->creator) and\n  creator-monetization (the creator's income).\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
